# Commit text files with LF on every platform. A Windows checkout or a script writing CRLF
# (Python's default text mode there) otherwise turns a one-line change into a whole-file diff.
# Windows batch files keep their CRLF bytes as committed.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat -text
*.cmd -text

